Get Optical Links Config for RMOD
    [Documentation]
    ...   Gets optical links configuration for RMOD by given RMOD ID.
    ...   Examlpe return:
    ...     [{'link_id': 1,
    ...       'optical_switch': <taf.config.testline.optical_switch.Leoni object at 0x7ff5e5161910>,
    ...       'module_no': 3,
    ...       'channel_no': 1,
    ...       'channel_amount': 4},
    ...      {'link_id': 2,
    ...       'optical_switch': <taf.config.testline.optical_switch.Leoni object at 0x7ff5e5161910>,
    ...       'module_no': 2,
    ...       'channel_no': 1,
    ...       'channel_amount': 4}]
    ...
    ...    ARGS:
    ...      :param str/int rmod_id: (Mandatory): Configuration ID of RMOD to get optical links configuration
    [Arguments]                     ${rmod_id}

    ${bts_type}                                    hwpta_testline.get_type_of_setup
    ${connection}                                  connections.get_default_admin_connection_alias
    ...                                            bts_type=${bts_type}

    ${rmod_serial_number}                          admin_info_model.get_serial_number_for_rmod
    ...                                            rmod_id=${rmod_id}
    ...                                            connection=${connection}
    ${rmod_index}                                  hwpta_testline.get_init_index_of_rmod_with_serial_number
    ...                                            serial_number=${rmod_serial_number}
    ...                                            bts_type=${bts_type}

    ${rmod_optical_switch_channels}                Set Variable If  '${bts_type}'=='GNB'
    ...                                            ${tl.gnbs[0].dus[0].rus[${rmod_index}].optical_switch_channels}
    ...                                            ${tl.enbs[0].rms[${rmod_index}].optical_switch_channels}

    ${rmod_optical_links_config}                   get_rmod_optical_links_config
    ...                                            rmod_optical_switch_channels=${rmod_optical_switch_channels}

    Robot Log Result                               Optical links configuration for RMOD-${rmod_id}: ${rmod_optical_links_config}

    [Return]    ${rmod_optical_links_config}
